    FEAT-0001: use Facilities' new field names, start_time and end_time
    
    Facilities renamed the fields again: startTime is now start_time, and
    endTime is now end_time.
    
    This is the same kind of change as in 01-booking. There, it changed
    the business logic and broke two of the three tests. Here it changed
    JsonBookingStore, the data file, and one test: the integration test
    that reads the file's field names. No business logic, no unit test, and
    no end-to-end test changed. Each test only crosses what it checks.

